  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s World Banking -  Southeast Asia (2016 - 2025)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports Women&apos;s World Banking (WWB), a leading global organisation on women&apos;s financial inclusion, giving low-income women increased access to financial tools and resources. In addition to global activities, the investment supports specific work in Southeast Asia. WWB analysed market opportunities and the capacity of financial institutions in Indonesia, Cambodia and Vietnam to serve low-income women. With financial sector and government partners, WWB activities focus on 1) understanding women&#x2019;s needs, behaviours and preferences; 2) developing and scaling financial products; 3) strengthening institutions and leadership to better meet women&#x2019;s needs; and 4) advocating for women&#x2019;s financial inclusion.</narrative>
  </description>
